Hope the northern hemisphere summer is going well for all. I wanted to drop a hint for those of you busily gathering data during your field season that I hope to offer an online introductory distance sampling training workshop in the autumn. Speculative dates are 07-18 October.  Perhaps that will be well-timed for analysing all those delightful distance sampling data you've been gathering.

